    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1186">

                <pb facs="1020" n="916" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg916"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 704.9312/11a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American Consuls at
                        Nogales, Cananea, Hermosillo and Guaymas.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chinese Minister here represents to the Department that Chinese in Sonora are
                    suffering great hardships, that two of them were recently killed, and that much
                    of their property has been destroyed. The Department desires that you render,
                    when it may seem <pb facs="1021" n="917" xml:id="pg917"/> necessary, such
                    informal good offices as may be possible and as you are permitted to exercise by
                    the local authorities, to Chinese resident in Mexico.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
